  "body": "Tick all the boxes in one of Mairangi Bay’s most sought-after neighbourhoods — premium school zones, sea views, sunshine, space, and the beachside lifestyle all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nBuilt by the current owner just six years ago and beautifully maintained ever since, this exceptional family home also comes with the added peace of mind of Master Build Guarantee cover.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern family living, the home features 4 generous bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms plus a study, two kitchens, a sunny balcony, an internal-access garage and additional off-street parking. With excellent separation of living spaces, there’s plenty of room for the whole family to enjoy.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned to capture the sun, its desirable north-east facing aspect fills the home with natural light while offering lovely sea views. Double glazing provides year-round comfort, warmth and added sound insulation.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a covered outdoor deck offers a sheltered space for children and pets to play, while the flexible living areas provide privacy and versatility for families of all sizes.\r\n\r\nLocated in a well-established and highly regarded neighbourhood, this home is within walking distance of Mairangi Bay Beach and its vibrant seaside village, with popular cafés, restaurants and bars. Supermarkets, excellent schools and everyday amenities are all conveniently close by.\r\n\r\nContact us today for viewing!",
